ual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"白褒","kind":"person","person_id":"wqq_rkx_bnu","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-w043-shantao-30","person_id":"wqq_rkx_bnu","title":"左丞","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-shantao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025","quote":"咸甯初，轉太子少傅，加散騎常侍；除尚書僕射，加侍中，領吏部。固辭以老疾，上表陳情。章表數十上，久不攝職，為左丞白褒所奏。帝曰：「濤以病自聞，但不聽之耳。使濤坐執銓衡則可，何必上下邪！不得有所問。」濤不自安，表謝曰：「古之王道，正直而已。陛下不可以一老臣為加曲私，臣亦何必屢陳日月。乞如所表，以章典刑。」帝再手詔曰：「白褒奏君甚妄，所以不即推，直不喜凶赫耳。君之明度，豈當介意邪！便當攝職，令斷章表也。」濤志必欲退，因發從弟婦喪，輒還外舍。詔曰：「山僕射近日暫出，遂以微苦未還，豈吾側席之意。其遣丞掾奉詔諭旨，若體力故未平康者，便以輿車輿還寺舍。」濤辭不獲已，乃起視事。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0055"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w043-shantao-30:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"左丞","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0055","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025","text":"咸甯初，轉太子少傅，加散騎常侍；除尚書僕射，加侍中，領吏部。固辭以老疾，上表陳情。章表數十上，久不攝職，為左丞白褒所奏。帝曰：「濤以病自聞，但不聽之耳。使濤坐執銓衡則可，何必上下邪！不得有所問。」濤不自安，表謝曰：「古之王道，正直而已。陛下不可以一老臣為加曲私，臣亦何必屢陳日月。乞如所表，以章典刑。」帝再手詔曰：「白褒奏君甚妄，所以不即推，直不喜凶赫耳。君之明度，豈當介意邪！便當攝職，令斷章表也。」濤志必欲退，因發從弟婦喪，輒還外舍。詔曰：「山僕射近日暫出，遂以微苦未還，豈吾側席之意。其遣丞掾奉詔諭旨，若體力故未平康者，便以輿車輿還寺舍。」濤辭不獲已，乃起視事。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"白褒","kind":"person","person_id":"wqq_rkx_bnu","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"白褒","kind":"person","person_id":"wqq_rkx_bnu","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0201","start":201,"end":202,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0223","start":223,"end":226,"surface":"山僕射","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao:line025:m0273","start":273,"end":274,"surface":"濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":25,"last_line":25,"raw_start":1251,"raw_end":1537,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shantao","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-shantao"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006","text":"臣聞息夫歷詆，漢有正刑；白褒一奏，晉以明罰。況乎附下訕上，毀譽自口者哉。風聞尚書左丞臣范縝，自晉安還，語人云：「我不詣餘人，惟詣王亮；不餉餘人，惟餉王亮。」輒收縝白從左右萬休到臺辨問，與風聞符同。又今月十日，御餞梁州刺史臣珍國，宴私旣洽，羣臣並已謁退，時詔留侍中臣昂等十人，訪以政道。縝不答所問，而橫議沸騰，遂貶裁司徒臣朏，褒舉庶人王亮。臣于時預奉恩留，肩隨並立，耳目所接，差非風聞。竊尋王有遊豫，親御軒陛，義深推轂，情均《湛露》。酒闌宴罷，當扆正立，記事在前，記言在後，軫早朝之念，深求瘼之情，而縝言不遜，妄陳褒貶，傷濟濟之風，缺側席之望。不有嚴裁，憲準將頹，縝卽主。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":21,"last_line":21,"raw_start":996,"raw_end":1281,"raw_character_offsets":[996,997,998,999,1000,1001,1002,1003,1004,1005,1006,1007,1008,1009,1010,1011,1012,1013,1014,1015,1016,1017,1018,1019,1020,1021,1022,1023,1024,1025,1026,1027,1028,1029,1030,1031,1032,1033,1034,1035,1036,1037,1038,1039,1040,1041,1042,1043,1044,1045,1046,1047,1048,1049,1050,1051,1052,1053,1054,1055,1056,1057,1058,1059,1060,1061,1062,1063,1064,1065,1066,1067,1068,1069,1070,1071,1072,1073,1074,1075,1076,1077,1078,1079,1080,1081,1082,1083,1084,1085,1086,1087,1088,1089,1090,1091,1092,1093,1094,1095,1096,1097,1098,1099,1100,1101,1102,1103,1104,1105,1106,1107,1108,1109,1110,1111,1112,1113,1114,1115,1116,1117,1118,1119,1120,1121,1122,1123,1124,1125,1126,1127,1128,1129,1130,1131,1132,1133,1134,1135,1136,1137,1138,1139,1140,1141,1142,1143,1144,1145,1146,1147,1148,1149,1150,1151,1152,1153,1154,1155,1156,1157,1158,1159,1160,1161,1162,1163,1164,1165,1166,1167,1168,1169,1170,1171,1172,1173,1174,1175,1176,1177,1178,1179,1180,1181,1182,1183,1184,1185,1186,1187,1188,1189,1190,1191,1192,1193,1194,1195,1196,1197,1198,1199,1200,1201,1202,1203,1204,1205,1206,1207,1208,1209,1210,1211,1212,1213,1214,1215,1216,1217,1218,1219,1220,1221,1222,1223,1224,1225,1226,1227,1228,1229,1230,1231,1232,1233,1234,1235,1236,1237,1238,1239,1240,1241,1242,1243,1244,1245,1246,1247,1248,1249,1250,1251,1252,1253,1254,1255,1256,1257,1258,1259,1260,1261,1262,1263,1264,1265,1266,1267,1268,1269,1270,1271,1272,1273,1274,1275,1276,1277,1278,1279,1280],"revision_id":1508503},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"